TI  - Critical appraisal of the management of severe malnutrition: 1. Epidemiology and treatment guidelines
AU  - David Brewster
JO  - Journal of Paediatrics and Child Health
PY  - 2006
VL  - 42
IS  - 10
SP  - 568
