TI  - Mechanisms of Kwashiorkor-Associated Immune Suppression: Insights From Human, Mouse, and Pig Studies
AU  - Husheem Michael
AU  - Joshua O. Amimo
AU  - Gireesh Rajashekara
AU  - Linda J. Saif
AU  - Anastasia N. Vlasova
JO  - Frontiers in Immunology
PY  - 2022
VL  - 13
SP  - 826268
