TI  - Systemic inflammation is negatively associated with early post discharge growth following acute illness among severely malnourished children - a pilot study
AU  - James M. Njunge
AU  - Gerard Bryan Gonzales
AU  - Moses M. Ngari
AU  - Johnstone Thitiri
AU  - Robert Bandsma
