AU  - Sara Wuehler
AU  - Abdoulazize Biga Hassoumi
JO  - Maternal and Child Nutrition
PY  - 2011
VL  - 7
IS  - s1
SP  - 133
EP  - 156
DO  - 10.1111/j.1740-8709.2010.00307.x
