TI  - A local-ingredients-based supplement is an alternative to corn-soy blends plus for treating moderate acute malnutrition among children aged 6 to 59 months: A randomized controlled non-inferiority trial in Wolaita, Southern Ethiopia
AU  - Debritu Nane
AU  - Anne Hatløy
AU  - Bernt Lindtjørn
JO  - PLoS ONE
PY  - 2021
VL  - 16
IS  - 10
SP  - e0258715
